          "passage": "New research suggests that coffee could have a\npositive effect on cardiovascular health.\nAlthough caffeine is coffee's most well-known\nconstituent, the beverage contains more than\n100 biologically active components. In a study\nled by Jiyoung Kim, researchers at Seoul\nNational University concluded that\nnon-caffeinated compounds likely play a role in\nthe positive relationship between coffee\nconsumption and health.",
