            "It is easier to detect low and harmless\nconcentrations of T iO2-NPs in D.\npolymorpha than it is to detect high and\nharmful concentrations ofT iO2-NPs in C.\ncarpio.",
            "T iO2-NP concentrations in D. polymorpha\ntend to vary more from individual to\nindividual than doT iO2-NP\nconcentrations in C. carpio when the\nspecies are exposed to similar levels of\nT iO2-NPs."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q21). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
