            "The time references of noon (12 p.m.) and\nmidnight (12 a.m.) are used with roughly\nthe same frequency in the novels.",
            "Novels published after 1880 contain\nsignificantly more references to activities\noccurring after 10 p.m. than do novels\nfrom earlier periods."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q22). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
