            "Mantle-derived rocks younger than 3.2\nbillion years contain some material that is\nnot found in older mantle-derived rocks\nbut is found in older and contemporaneous\nlithospheric rocks."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q23). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
