            "Consumers tended to purchase more\nproducts in categories in which\nextended-brand pairs are found than in\ncategories in which extended-brand pairs\nare not found."
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is B (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q24). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
