            "The CFRP electrode is incompatible with\nmost wireless communication devices.",
            "The high conductivity of the CFRP is\nwhat makes the energy output from a\npiezoelectric harvester sufficient for\nwireless communication devices."
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is B (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q45). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
