            "Waterbird communities at Old Road, a\nsite with a relatively high percentage of\nshoreline consisting of bulkheads, had\nlower average IWCI scores than did\nwaterbird communities at Miles, a site\nwith a relatively high percentage of\nshoreline consisting of riprap.",
